# L §5.6: an index "may carry assumed STR ...; every figure keyed by it, and every result that reaches one, then
# lists assumed: <index>: <reason> in its register (§8.2)."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

index tys = year 2025..2026 from 04-06
  assumed "no source gives the tax year's start"

input n[t in tys]: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  n[*] = 1

ask q1: n[2025] law 2026-01-01
=== expect
q1: 1
  assumed: tys: no source gives the tax year's start
  law date 2026-01-01, cut 2026-01-01
